Z||000000||Fiero Sam||06-25-2001||06:53 PM||||I have time to write a poem about my favorite actress:Sarah Michelle Gellar!<BR>This poem is completely serious,not the least bit Tongue-in cheek(If only!)<BR>S is for her wonderful Smile<BR>A is for Angel(that's what she is)<BR>R is for Rooby Roo<BR>A is for.....never mind what A is for<BR>H is for her beautiful hair(no matter what color it is)<P>M is for my desire to kiss her right on the Mouth<BR>I is for I Know What You Did Last Summer<BR>C is for my Car,because I would like to drive her to my place in my car where we would watch the Orioles play on TV while eating those little cheese and breadstick things and then afterwards we would sit in front of a roaring fire(wait a minute,I drive a Fiero,Forget about that roaring fire thing!)<BR>H is there because it would be spelled wrong without it<BR>E is for those beautiful Eyes<BR>L is for those great(but not real long)legs<BR>L is for those wonderful lips<BR>E is for her ears(because I said so)<P>G is for Girl(you can tell she's a girl just by looking at her)<BR>E is for....Why does she have so many E's in her name anyway?I'll have to think about this for awhile<BR>L is for Love,because I love her a whole big bunch<BR>L is for Los Angelos,because she lives around there somewhere<BR>A is for Acting,because that's what she does<BR>R is not for that no-good freddie prinze jr.<P>I know! That last E is for Everything Else!<BR>It's starting again.....<P>||||reg||1
